                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is iD Fresh's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Cold-chain infrastructure + category creation + retail distribution + values-first founder story. Multi-decade compounding advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can smaller fresh food brands compete with iD Fresh?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in category niching (specific regional cuisines, healthier variants, premium organic). Category has room for multiple positioning.</p>
                                        <h3>Is fresh food D2C possible?</h3>
                                        <p>Direct D2C for fresh food is operationally intensive + hard. Most fresh food scales via retail. D2C works for specific categories (specialty desserts, meal kits) but not mainstream fresh.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest fresh food lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Cold-chain infrastructure is the moat. Marketing without cold-chain investment fails at scale for fresh categories.</p>
